//    decoding with SafeRepetitionPenaltyStep + CloseSpanIfComplete.
// 6. The guidance explicitly tells the model: write reasoning first, then
//    emit exactly one <<EXPR>> with plain arithmetic only, no LaTeX.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_BEGIN
